e-The-Fun Pass\nIncludes: Helmet, Vest & House Wakeboard (Non-Obstacle)\nObstacle Wakeboard Rental: $20/Session\n\n- Rate is inclusive of GST & applicable daily\n- Recommended age for a participating child is 6 years old & above\n- All riders are required to know basic swimming"}]]}],"$L3","$L4"]}]]}],null,"$L5"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"GtlyCSOmbjc6KDs2gevVf"}
